Vendored MapLibre base styles for the Protomaps basemap schema, generated by generate.mjs from the
@protomaps/basemaps package (https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Protomaps LLC) on 2026-10-01.
Flavors: light, white, grayscale, dark, black, plus our own classic and vivid-dark (colors overridden in generate.mjs). data-manager patches them at build time (services/map_styles.py),
it never edits these files. Re-vendor by running generate.mjs when the schema or package changes.

Glyph and sprite URLs point at https://protomaps.github.io/basemaps-assets (protomaps/basemaps-assets, Noto Sans
fonts under OFL, sprites BSD-3) and are replaced on export by Settings -> Public URLs.
The tiles source URL is the placeholder pmtiles://__TILES__, replaced on export/preview.

Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). No OpenMapTiles credit is needed any more.
